	"data": "Project: Air Hockey MR (Meta Quest 3)\n\nWhat It Is\nA full mixed reality air hockey game built for Meta Quest 3 in Unity. Not a prototype or test bed — a complete game with a roadmap, GitHub project tracking, AI opponents, multiplayer, and a planned Meta Store submission.\n\n\"I want to try to get to six-hour days working on air hockey... my goal is publishing it by the end of the month.\"\n— Final Air Hockey Prep, Aug 2024\n\nCore Concept\nPlay air hockey on any real-world surface. Point your headset at…",
